    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to the establishment of a program for familial dysautonomia, Canavan's disease and Tay-Sachs disease screening and counseling",
    "basePrintNo": "S7976",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7976-2009",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
